<title>CROATIA: Croatian stocks mostly lower in lacklustre trade.</title>
<headline>Croatian stocks mostly lower in lacklustre trade.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Croatian stocks were mostly lower in moderate trade on Wednesday and cable maker Elka led the gainers.</p>
<p>* Of 13 active issues, nine fell, three rose and one was unchanged.</p>
<p>* Volume was higher at 10,369 shares on a slightly lower turnover of 3.7 million kuna.</p>
</text>
